### Step 2: Bug Code Snippet Analysis & Bug Location

**File:** `packages/react/src/components/ComboBox/ComboBox.js`

**Relevant Code:**
```javascript
<ListBox.Menu aria-label={ariaLabel} id={id}>
  {this.filterItems(items, itemToString, inputValue).map(
    (item, index) => (
      <ListBox.MenuItem
        key={itemToString(item)}
        ...
      >
        {itemToElement ? (
          <ItemToElement key={itemToString(item)} {...item} />
        ) : (
          itemToString(item)
        )}
      </ListBox.MenuItem>
    )
  )}
</ListBox.Menu>
```
- The problematic line is `key={itemToString(item)}`. This should use a unique property, such as `item.id`, falling back to `itemToString(item)` if `id` is not present.

